# Rootwise Survivor: "That land becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature in addition to its other types" (CR 205.1b, 613.1d). Mutavault,
# animated on turn 3 before Survival ({1}: 2/2 creature with all creature types until end of turn), is targeted at the second main
# phase: it keeps all creature types beside Elemental (the Elemental type is added, none lost); the 0/0 is a later base
# power and toughness than its 2/2 (CR 613.4b, timestamp order), so it is 3/3 with the counters. At the end of the turn Mutavault's
# own effect wears off, and what Rootwise made lasts: a 3/3 Elemental creature land with Mutavault's single land type and no more.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mutavault
Rootwise Survivor
Forest
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

